{"id":3161,"slug":"3161-pytest-parametrize-viet-parameterized-tests-the-nao","category":"Python","subcategory":"Database & Testing","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"pytest parametrize — viết parameterized tests thế nào?","question_en":"pytest parametrize — how to write parameterized tests?","answer_vi":"`@pytest.mark.parametrize` cho phép chạy cùng test với nhiều input/output khác nhau:\n```python\nimport pytest\n\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\"email,is_valid\", [\n    (\"user@example.com\", True),\n    (\"invalid-email\", False),\n    (\"@nodomain.com\", False),\n    (\"user@.com\", False),\n    (\"\", False),\n])\ndef test_validate_email(email: str, is_valid: bool):\n    assert validate_email(email) == is_valid\n\n# Multiple params\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\"a,b,expected\", [\n    (1, 2, 3),\n    (0, 0, 0),\n    (-1, 1, 0),\n    (100, 200, 300),\n])\ndef test_add(a, b, expected):\n    assert add(a, b) == expected\n\n# Nested parametrize — cartesian product\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\"base\", [2, 10])\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\"exponent\", [0, 1, 2])\ndef test_power(base, exponent):\n    assert power(base, exponent) == base ** exponent\n# 6 test cases: (2,0), (2,1), (2,2), (10,0), (10,1), (10,2)\n\n# Với pytest.param cho custom IDs hoặc marks\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\"value\", [\n    pytest.param(None, id=\"null-value\"),\n    pytest.param([], marks=pytest.mark.xfail, id=\"empty-list\"),\n])\ndef test_process(value): ...\n```","answer_en":"```python\nimport pytest\n\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\"email,is_valid\", [\n    (\"user@example.com\", True),\n    (\"invalid-email\", False),\n    (\"\", False),\n])\ndef test_validate_email(email, is_valid):\n    assert validate_email(email) == is_valid\n\n# Nested — cartesian product\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\"base\", [2, 10])\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\"exponent\", [0, 1, 2])\ndef test_power(base, exponent):\n    assert power(base, exponent) == base ** exponent  # 6 test cases\n\n# Custom IDs\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\"value\", [\n    pytest.param(None, id=\"null\"),\n    pytest.param([], marks=pytest.mark.xfail, id=\"empty\"),\n])\ndef test_process(value): ...\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>@pytest.mark.parametrize</code> cho phép chạy cùng test với nhiều input/output khác nhau:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">python</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"import pytest\n\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(&quot;email,is_valid&quot;, [\n    (&quot;user@example.com&quot;, True),\n    (&quot;invalid-email&quot;, False),\n    (&quot;@nodomain.com&quot;, False),\n    (&quot;user@.com&quot;, False),\n    (&quot;&quot;, False),\n])\ndef test_validate_email(email: str, is_valid: bool):\n    assert validate_email(email) == is_valid\n\n# Multiple params\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(&quot;a,b,expected&quot;, [\n    (1, 2, 3),\n    (0, 0, 0),\n    (-1, 1, 0),\n    (100, 200, 300),\n])\ndef test_add(a, b, expected):\n    assert add(a, b) == expected\n\n# Nested parametrize — cartesian product\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(&quot;base&quot;, [2, 10])\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(&quot;exponent&quot;, [0, 1, 2])\ndef test_power(base, exponent):\n    assert power(base, exponent) == base ** exponent\n# 6 test cases: (2,0), (2,1), (2,2), (10,0), (10,1), (10,2)\n\n# Với pytest.param cho custom IDs hoặc marks\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(&quot;value&quot;, [\n    pytest.param(None, id=&quot;null-value&quot;),\n    pytest.param([], marks=pytest.mark.xfail, id=&quot;empty-list&quot;),\n])\ndef test_process(value): ...\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" vie